sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor H as Human
    participant A as AI Agent
    participant K as Input Hook
    participant C as Rust Core
    participant B as Approved baseline
    participant M as MCP
    H->>A: New request
    A->>K: UserPromptSubmit event
    K->>C: assess(prompt)
    C->>B: read approved requirements
    B-->>C: requirement clauses
    C-->>K: outcome + top 3 evidence
    alt No explicit divergence
       K-->>A: allow + minimal related context
       A-->>H: proceed with work
    else Suspected contradiction / new requirement
       K-->>H: block + source lines + A/B/C/D
       H->>A: Discuss Concept
       A->>M: concept_discuss
       M-->>A: approved clause and conflict
       A-->>H: decision options and impact
       H->>C: local human TTY decision
       C-->>H: audit decision; reapproval if requirements changed
    end
